        "affiliation": "Ampex Corporation Redwood City, California",
        "bio": "John Watney was born and educated in South Africa receiving BSc. (E.E.) and MSc. (Phys.) degrees from the University of Cape Town. He worked for Marconi's Wireless Telegraph Company in England and for the CSIR in South Africa before joining Ampex in 1964. While at Ampex, he has worked in the Videofile Division, the Data Systems Division and the Audio Video Systems Division, as well as earning an Engineer's Degree from Stanford University. His interests center around things digital: recording, communication and control.",
